 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.11-rc30 — Hub check-ins & Silk
+
+- **Hub check-in:** spend 10 minutes in the UnderWeb hub with UWX open and you're checked in for the day. Only your own visit is sent — never who else is there or which instance.
+- **Silk in your account:**
+  - +25 a day for visiting the hub.
+  - +50 and an "I was there" badge during UnderWeb events.
+  - A weekly streak bonus.
+  - +10 per approved photo.
+  - +100 per friend staff verify you brought in.
+- The **Silk & hub check-ins** card on Command shows your balance, this week, your streak, badges, recent Silk and the weekly leaderboard. A switch turns visit counting off.
+- **Owners:** stand in the hub and click **Add this world** so visits count there.
+
 ## 0.6.10-rc29 — Moderation log in Discord
 
 - **Discord moderation log:** UnderWeb's server posts bans, unbans, removals, instance kicks and warnings, and case updates (opened, status changes, recorded actions, appeals) to your private staff channel. It works even when nobody has UWX open, and each item posts exactly once no matter how many staff are syncing. It never posts evidence, notes, locations or instance links.
